  "name" : "Strasen2018 - TGFb SMAD Signalling - Restimulation with 5pM TGFb at 8hr",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>Restimulation with 5pM TGFβ at 8 hrs, shown in Figure 4F  </pre>      </body>    </notes>",
